  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This kit contains a Remote Controller and a USB controller. We have prepared this replacement kit for RGB LED Strip Light and S-shape LED Strip Light (WS2812B RGB) to cover any possible loss or damage during the crafting process."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Consideration"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Before making any modifications to the device, ensure that the LED strip is unplugged. Electrical currents can be dangerous and may result in electrical shock or injury in certain cases."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "This product is not a toy. Please keep it out of reach of children."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h1 class=\"pct_t\"></h1>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"></div>\n<h1 class=\"pct_t\"><!-- 查看PDF结束 --></h1>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview</h2>\n<p></p>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"BjvldvnAaoycINxd2bmcCShOnbh\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AJG2dksdho04tWx9yaycab9anG6\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"JIx8duNU1oVcInxvSpsc9j9dnSH\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-FwKZd9oSlohHnSxpBvlc0zurnV2\">This kit contains<b> </b>a<strong> Remote Controller </strong>and a <strong>USB controller. </strong>We have prepared this replacement kit for<strong> <span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/ws2812b-rgb-led-strip-light-bundle?_pos=1&amp;_sid=f88ff7a52&amp;_ss=r\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\">RGB LED Strip Light</a></span></strong> and <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/s-shape-led-strip-light-ws2812b-rgb?_pos=1&amp;_sid=8ab7f7996&amp;_ss=r\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>S-shape LED Strip Light (WS2812B RGB)</strong></span></a> to cover any possible loss or damage during the crafting process.</div>\n<div class=\"old-record-id-FwKZd9oSlohHnSxpBvlc0zurnV2\"></div>\n<div class=\"old-record-id-FwKZd9oSlohHnSxpBvlc0zurnV2\"></div>\n<div class=\"old-record-id-FwKZd9oSlohHnSxpBvlc0zurnV2\"></div>\n<div class=\"old-record-id-FwKZd9oSlohHnSxpBvlc0zurnV2\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Key Features</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"old-record-id-FwKZd9oSlohHnSxpBvlc0zurnV2\"></div>\n<div class=\"old-record-id-FwKZd9oSlohHnSxpBvlc0zurnV2\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"JIx8duNU1oVcInxvSpsc9j9dnSH\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line a